embed · generate · rerank" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="70" width="190" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r1" target="sM"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r2" target="sQ"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r4" target="sQ"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r6" target="sN"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r9" target="sM"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r10" target="sP"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r3b" target="sP"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="qpanel" value="CHẨN ĐOÁN CHẤT LƯỢNG RETRIEVAL (theo smoke-test: intent=general, entities=[], score≈0.016)

★3 canonicalize RỖNG: LLM local trả intent=general, entities=[] ⇒ mất lọc-entity (pass-1) + mất seed graph (bước 6) ⇒ tụt về vector thuần.
   → Kiểm tra model /generate (litellm), prompt, JSON parse. Thử model tốt hơn cho bước canonicalize.

★6 graph_expand vô dụng nếu không có entity seed (do ★3 rỗng) HOẶC Neo4j chưa có cạnh (:RELATES) cho tenant.

★9 rerank: nếu model /rerank lỗi → im lặng fallback về thứ tự RRF (điểm thấp). Kiểm tra cross-encoder có chạy.

★4c BM25 đang TẮT (HYBRID_LEXICAL=0): bật lên (sau khi chạy migration FTS) để cứu truy vấn tên riêng/keyword.

Ngữ liệu nhỏ (1 doc) ⇒ RRF/rerank gần như vô nghĩa. Nạp thêm tài liệu rồi đánh giá lại.
Ngưỡng: NEO4J_TOP_ENTITIES, QDRANT_PASS1/2_LIMIT, RERANK_TOP_N, CACHE_THRESHOLD — chỉnh theo dữ liệu." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;align=left;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="130" width="640" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>